@startuml architecture-nearest-station-weather
title Nearest Station Weather Architecture Flow

actor User
participant "Dashboard Page" as Dashboard
participant "Weather Data Route" as Route
participant "Weather Service" as Service
database "Weather Station Repository" as StationRepo
database "Weather Data Repository" as DataRepo
participant "External Weather API" as ExternalApi
participant "Station Refresh Job" as RefreshJob

User -> Dashboard
Dashboard -> Route: Request weather for coordinates
Route -> Service: Get weather for location

Service -> StationRepo: Get station catalog
StationRepo --> Service: Station catalog

alt Station catalog missing or stale
  Service -> ExternalApi: Fetch station catalog
  ExternalApi --> Service: Station catalog
  Service -> StationRepo: Store or update station catalog
  StationRepo --> Service: Station catalog
end

Service -> Service: Find nearest station
Service -> DataRepo: Check cached weather data for station and fixed date range

alt Required weather dates available locally
  DataRepo --> Service: Weather data
else Required weather dates are missing or stale
  Service -> ExternalApi: Fetch missing weather data
  ExternalApi --> Service: Weather data
  Service -> DataRepo: Store or update weather data
  DataRepo --> Service: Complete weather data
end

Service --> Route: Weather data
Route --> Dashboard: Response
Dashboard --> User: Render charts

RefreshJob -> ExternalApi: Fetch station catalog
ExternalApi --> RefreshJob: Station catalog
RefreshJob -> StationRepo: Update station catalog

@enduml